{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Professor Ary 是一款專為家庭設計的平靜風格閃卡應用，適合父母與幼兒、學前兒童共同使用。該 App 目前提供限時免費下載機會，讓家長能以零成本體驗其精心策劃的圖像卡片庫，協助孩子在輕鬆無干擾的環境中啟蒙學習。</p>\n\n<h2>多元主題與多語支持</h2>\n<p>內建四個精選主題庫涵蓋首詞、動物、日常物品及世界知識共計超過四百張卡片。每個庫均設guided rounds、快速遊戲及可列印練習頁。App 支援二十種語言選項包括中英文等，並承諾無廣告、無需註冊帳號且介面簡潔專注，極適合照護者主導的日常重複教學。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-537-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-538-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-539-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-540-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-541-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-542-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Professor Ary: Baby Flashcards</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T13:58:30.833867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}